-723f03855f59" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333445 1145 "The particle's velocity vector is given by the derivative of its position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{2}-1)),\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4t-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2}-1),4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333447 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333448 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333449 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333450 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333451 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1041 "selection" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1104 #edb/ref 17592186333451 13194139535142 true] [17592186333446 1110 #uuid "287ebbd8-c07d-5409-838a-41b78a9b9d19" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333447 1034 "v=⟨2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2}-1),4⟩" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333447 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535142 true] [17592186333447 1111 #uuid "cb720dfd-53af-583b-b34c-43d9679b51dd" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333448 1034 "v=⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2}-1),-4⟩" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333448 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535142 true] [17592186333448 1111 #uuid "013dacef-73e2-5f3c-ba74-402ebc078fa2" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333449 1034 "v=⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2}-1),4⟩" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333449 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535142 true] [17592186333449 1111 #uuid "4b42682f-ace7-5a19-988e-06070c4021b6" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333450 1034 "v=⟨-2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2}-1),-4⟩" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333450 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535142 true] [17592186333450 1111 #uuid "bfb862a6-6085-504a-a189-5cdb10d4f6e1" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333451 1034 "v=⟨-2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2}-1),4⟩" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333451 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535142 true] [17592186333451 1111 #uuid "29c97baa-19fa-5461-8bd0-074df97c32f2" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333452 1017 #edb/ref 17592186333453 13194139535142 true] [17592186333452 1089 "q-121719" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333452 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535142 true] [17592186333452 1100 "The position vector $r$ of a particle $P$ (relative to a fixed origin $O$) at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nr=⟨t+4,\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5t+1)⟩,\\,t>0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the velocity vector $v$ at time $t=3.$" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333452 1113 #uuid "03870043-e61d-591f-9542-928769f96294" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333452 1145 "The particle's velocity vector is given by the derivative of its position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+4),\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5t+1))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\frac{5}{5t+1}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the velocity when $t=3,$ we substitute into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(3) & =⟨1,\\frac{5}{5(3)+1}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\frac{5}{16}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333454 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333455 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333456 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333457 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333458 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1041 "selection" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1104 #edb/ref 17592186333456 13194139535142 true] [17592186333453 1110 #uuid "d4053636-baf7-51ec-b9f5-03830a0a55f3" 13194139535142 true] [17592186333454 1034 "v(3)=⟨7,\\frac{5}{16}⟩"